"Stored length fn (range): 100"
"Compare gt: 1"
"Compare eq: 0"
"Compare lt: -1"
"Flattened arrays: [ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 ]"
"Joined words: hello world"
"bit-and(7, 3) = 3"
"bit-or(4, 2) = 6"
"neg(-42) = 42"
"neg(3.14) = -3.14"
